    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Context Assembler Stable v1",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Date: 2026-05-18. HEAD: 7b4e5166.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status: CONTEXT_ASSEMBLER_STABLE_V1",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The context assembler is stable, tested, and privacy-hardened. All critical-path failures emit structured warnings. No silent `except: pass` remains in the compiler, planner, or renderer execution paths.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Stable API",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-6",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Component",
        "Entry point",
        "Contract"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`ContextRequest`",
          "`rig_relay/context/models.py`",
          "Scope, budget, freshness, output, compression"
        ],
        [
          "`ContextPacket`",
          "`rig_relay/context/models.py`",
          "Canonical output with warnings, recommended_context, do_not_touch"
        ],
        [
          "`ContextAssemblyPlan`",
          "`rig_relay/context/assembly_plan.py`",
          "Candidates, selections, omissions, budget ledger, warnings, hashes"
        ],
        [
          "`ContextRenderer`",
          "`rig_relay/context/renderer.py`",
          "Cache-tiered sections, privacy-safe metadata, compression"
        ],
        [
          "`plan_context()`",
          "`rig_relay/context/planner.py`",
          "Deterministic discovery, RepoIndex expansion, scoring, budget enforcement"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Source truth",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "File",
        "Status"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`compiler.py`",
          "`execute()` calls `plan_context()` with `RepoContextIndex(root)`. `build_envelope()` uses `renderer.section_count`. `build_receipt()` has no bare `except: pass`. `_scan_receipts()` emits warnings on read failure."
        ],
        [
          "`planner.py`",
          "`_safe_find()` and `_safe_find_dict()` return `(result, error)` tuples. Per-method RepoIndex warnings emitted. Negative `max_tokens` clamped."
        ],
        [
          "`renderer.py`",
          "Imports `CacheTier`/`TrustTier` from `assembly_plan.py`. `section_metadata` returns `list[ContextRenderedSection]` — no raw content."
        ],
        [
          "`assembly_plan.py`",
          "Full model spine: `ContextCandidate`, `ContextSelection`, `ContextOmission`, `ContextBudgetLedger`, `ContextAssemblyWarning`, `ContextAssemblyPlan`."
        ],
        [
          "`models.py`",
          "`ContextPacket` has `warnings: list[dict[str, Any]]`."
        ],
        [
          "`warnings.py`",
          "`ContextWarningCode` with 13 codes. `build_warning()` helper. `exception_class_name()` helper."
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Warning policy",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-10",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Artifact",
        "Warnings?",
        "Rationale"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`ContextPacket`",
          "✅ Yes",
          "Primary carrier for request-execution warnings. Planner, RepoIndex, receipt-scan, and renderer warnings all flow here."
        ],
        [
          "`ContextEnvelopeReceipt`",
          "❌ No (v1)",
          "Remains prompt-envelope evidence. Warnings available via `ContextPacket`. Future model change if needed."
        ],
        [
          "`ContextReceipt`",
          "❌ No (v1)",
          "Remains summary evidence. Warnings available via `ContextPacket`. Future model change if needed."
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Privacy policy",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Recent messages: `role` + `sha256` + `byte_count` only. No raw content. - Repository root: `root_hash` only. No raw path. - Git head: `head_hash` only. - Collision paths: `path_hash` only. - Receipt paths: repo-relative only. - Warnings: `exception_class_name()` only. No raw exception messages, paths, or secrets.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Cache layout",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-14",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Tier",
        "Sections"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`stable`",
          "AGENTS/doctrine/schema — invariant rules"
        ],
        [
          "`semi_stable`",
          "Repo topology, subsystem map"
        ],
        [
          "`dynamic`",
          "Dirty files, active lanes, collisions"
        ],
        [
          "`volatile`",
          "User task hash, recent message metadata, receipts"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Security posture",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Context evidence is NOT instructions. All rendered context is labeled with `trust_tier` and `provenance`. Untrusted content (tool output, external docs) is separated from first-party doctrine. The assembler does not amplify prompt injection.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Remaining future work",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
